  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>By now, you are probably familiar with my Daily Dozen checklist, a simple tracker that can help you get into the habit of including some of the healthiest of healthy foods and exercise into your everyday routine. But, if you need some extra support and inspiration to get those boxes checked off, join our free Daily Dozen Digest—an 11-week email series full of facts and recipes, all to help you on your health journey. Watch our new video about the Daily Dozen app below, and <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sign up here</a> for the free Digest.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"entry-content-asset\"><iframe width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-tOdfgO31RA?feature=oembed&amp;rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" title=\"Dr. Greger&#39;s Daily Dozen App\"></iframe></div>\n<p></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Donations Matched!</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=61&amp;&amp;test=true\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68093 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Square.jpg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p>One of our amazing supporters, Janet Bruce, will match all donations using <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=61&amp;&amp;test=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/campaign.jsp?campaign=61&amp;&amp;test=true\">this form</a> for up to a total of $15,000!</p>\n<p>Double your impact by making a donation to NutritionFacts.org today…and <em>thank you for your support!</em></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4>Key Takeaways: Smoothies </h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/smoothies/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68095 size-large\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Smoothies.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p>Smoothies can either be filled with dairy and sugar or be made with some of the healthiest foods on the planet. What does the science say about them? Is there anything we need to be cautious about? Check out the smoothie <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/smoothies/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">topic page</a> for a full summary, as well as my videos. (I even have a video where I make my own smoothie recipe!)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Recipe: Barley Tabbouli Salad with Tahini Drizzle</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-68128 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/Barley-Tabbouli-Salad-with-Tahini-Drizzle-EN-1-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></p>\n<p>Intact barley stands in for cracked bulgur in this hearty salad, but you can use another whole grain if you prefer. This recipe is a great way to make use of any leftover cooked whole grains you may have on hand. A drizzle of tahini sauce adds a unique depth of flavor to the salad. You can find the full recipe <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/barley-tabbouli-salad-with-tahini-drizzle/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> and a video of how it’s made <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CPqqKgypm5S/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CPqqKgypm5S/\">here</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>PAN Is Hiring</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://pan-int.org/contribute/jobs/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68099\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/PAN_Medical_content_exec_job_newsletter-banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"207\"/></a>One of my favorite organizations, <a href=\"https://pan-int.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://pan-int.org/\">Physicans Association for Nutrition</a>, is looking for a whole food, plant-based nutrition expert for the position of Medical Content Executive. The position is fully remote, and candidates can be based anywhere in the EU, Africa, or USA (east coast). <a href=\"https://pan-int.org/contribute/jobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://pan-int.org/contribute/jobs\">Go here</a> for more information and to apply.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Spotlight Volunteer: João Madureira</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-68101\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-1024x1365.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-1024x1365.jpeg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-960x1280.jpeg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-768x1024.jpeg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-1200x1600.jpeg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-720x960.jpeg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/0bbf13ac-0927-e7d6-72ab-09bb53ea8f22-540x720.jpeg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></p>\n<p>I have been doing Portuguese translations for a few years. I love doing it, because it has a real impact on the health of so many people and the planet. The work of <a href=\"https://NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NutritionFacts.org</a> is very important for many reasons. One of the major reasons, in my view, is that it sharpens critical thinking and shows the biases that exist even in scientific work.</p>\n<p>My favorite whole food, plant-based dish is curry. I love to put a lot of antioxidant-rich spices in it, and I replace the oil with tomato paste and ground flaxseed.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-60211 aligncenter\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-causes-cancer-to-metastasize/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-67453\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"What Causes Cancer to Metastasize?\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/05/54-02-What-Causes-Cancer-to-Metastasize.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/what-causes-cancer-to-metastasize/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">What Causes Cancer to Metastasize?</a><br/>\nPalmitic acid, a saturated fat concentrated in meat and dairy, can boost the metastatic potential of cancer cells through the fat receptor CD36.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-benefits-of-moringa-is-it-the-most-nutritious-food/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-67871\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Benefits of Moringa: Is It the Most Nutritious Food?\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-benefits-of-moringa-is-it-the-most-nutritious-food/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Benefits of Moringa: Is It the Most Nutritious Superfood?</a><br/>\nDoes the so-called miracle tree live up to the hype?</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/flashback-friday-eating-more-to-weigh-less/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-59116\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"113\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/06/FBF-Eating-More-to-Weigh-Less.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/flashback-friday-eating-more-to-weigh-less/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Flashback Friday: Eating More to Weigh Less</a></p>\n<p>Energy density explains how a study can show participants lose an average of 17 pounds within 21 days while eating a greater quantity of food.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4>Next Live Q&amp;A on July 22</h4>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></p>\n<p>Every other month, I do a live Q&amp;A directly from my treadmill, and <em><strong>Thursday, July 22</strong></em> is the day.</p>\n<p>Join on our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\">Facebook</a> page or <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\">YouTube</a> channel at 3pm ET. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</p>\n<p>\nYou can find links to past live Q&amp;A’s <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, don’t forget I have an <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">audio podcast</a> to keep you company, too.</p>\n<p>\nAnd check out my recent dualing-treadmills interview with <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aa5E-BxLxdU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aa5E-BxLxdU\">The Jaroudi Family</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
